    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Level 6 — <strong>Shared Aura</strong></h2><p>You extend stability outward.</p><h3>Mechanical Effects</h3><p>While at <strong>Burn 1–3</strong>:</p><ul><li><p>Allies within 2 squares gain <strong>half your Aura’s passive benefit</strong></p><ul><li><p>Fury: +1 damage (once per turn)</p></li><li><p>Resolve: +1 Guard while stationary</p></li><li><p>Mercy: free nonlethal choice</p></li><li><p>Dread: reroll the lowest die against fear effects</p></li></ul></li></ul><p>This does <strong>not</strong> increase their Burn.</p><p>Your certainty becomes infrastructure.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
